    {
      "source": "RevertIQ",
      "text": "Swapos V2 on Ethereum Mainnet was drained on 2023-04-16 after a broken swap invariant let an attacker use 10 wei dust inputs to withdraw most of the SWP/WETH pool. Public reports place the loss at about $468,000. A mismatched constant-product check in swap() scaled post-swap balances by 10,000 but compared them against _reserve0 * _reserve1 * 1000 2, making the invariant too weak and allowing dust-sized inputs to pass."
    }
